(19150, 'Petersfield Open Air Pool', 'petersfield-open-air-pool', 2771, NULL, '', 'POASP/6a', '<p class=\\\"myclass\\\" style=\\\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\\\">Refurbishment of the Local Community Outdoor Open Air Swimming Pool.&nbsp; The pool was orginally built in the 1960\\\'s and has been refurbished from time to time over the years including a new plant room and retiling in the last 10 years.</p>\n<p class=\\\"myclass\\\" style=\\\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\\\">The pool was losing a lot of water and found to be leaking, there is a crack in the wall caused from settlement or failure from previous work to install concrete steps into the pool.&nbsp; Leaks have also been found around the old skimmers and top perimter of the pool where the original (filled in) scum channel was.</p>\n<p class=\\\"myclass\\\" style=\\\"font-family: sofia_pro_softlight;\\\">Our work involves rebuilding the steps and wall in the area where the pool is cracked, remove the copings and old scum channel and build this back up.&nbsp; All of the pipework is to be renewed around the pool and installing 14 brand Skimmers and 2 new Drains as well as 4 return inlets to bring the pool up to modern filtration standards.&nbsp; We will excavate and backfill as necessary around the perimter of the pool and back to the plant room.</p>', 9, 22, 1, '2020-01-27', '2020-04-30', 0, '2020-01-21 09:58:43', 'Heath Road, Petersfield, ', '\"\"', NULL, 'GU31 4DZ', 1, 1, 0, '0', 1),
