(20066, 'Newspaper House Swindon', 'newspaper-house-swindon', 3165, NULL, 'Newspaper House, Swindon.JPG', '032-NPH', 'Newspaper House is a part conversion and part new build project.&nbsp; Site A was used as offices with a large warehous to the rear - we have part of the warehouse to demolish and then the remaining space to soft strip - we then create 12x Commercial Retail Units and 39x 1 &amp; 2 Bed Apartments.&nbsp; Site B was another warehouse that is situated to the rear (seperate) this is to be demolished and we are building 3x 3 Bed Houses &amp; 11x 1 &amp; 2 Bed Apartments. Site C was their power and plant station - this is to be demolished and we are building some office space and the bin and bike store for Site A.&nbsp;', 10, 24, 1, '2020-08-05', '2022-03-31', 1, '2020-03-12 10:28:34', 'Newspaper House, 99-100 Victoria Road Swindon SN1 3BE (Known as Site A), Land at the corner of Albert Street & Little London, Swindon SN1 3HJ (Known as Site C) and Land between Albert Street, Church Road and Little London, Swindon SN1 3HJ ', '\"\"', NULL, 'SN1 3BE', 1, 1, 0, '0', 0),
