(22120, '271 RCS', '271-rcs', 3889, NULL, '271 LOB JILL communal space 2.jpg', 'Jill', 'This project is in Camden, North London and is the refrubishment of an existing: 65 m2, 2 bedroom ,2 bathroom flat on a ground &amp; lower ground floors of a property with a back garden Proposed: 80 m2, 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom with a rear extension and garden levels landscaped. &nbsp; The existing will be gutted out, new floor levels created at the rear to accommodate the new open plan kitchen living space. The ground floor will have the entrance, one bedroom and the master bathroom, the rear mezzanine will have a new internal courtyard levelled to the new kitchen living space created by constructing a 15 m2 extension to the mezzanine level, where the galley kitchen will be. The LG floor will need tanking after structural works are carried out and 2 new bedrooms and an en-suite (in the master bedroom) will be created.', 4, 23, 1, '2021-01-04', '2021-06-01', 0, '2020-10-30 09:34:50', '271 Royal College Street, Camden, London', '\"\"', NULL, 'NW1 9LU', 4, 3, 0, '0', 1),
(22134, 'Portal West', 'portal-west', 3887, NULL, 'portal-west.jpg', '13262', 'The main contract works comprise the provision of 701 apartments. The apartments are spread over 4 separate blocks Blocks A (55 storeys - 362 Flats), B (9 storeys - 31 Flats), C (38 storeys - 251 Flats) &amp; D (11 storeys - 57 Flats).', 4, 24, 1, '2018-07-09', '2023-02-23', 3, '2020-11-03 11:34:58', '6 Portal Way, Acton, London', '\"\"', NULL, 'W3 6RU', 4, 3, 0, '0', 0),
(22137, 'Wickside', 'wickside', 3887, NULL, 'Wickside-09-700x472.jpg', '13267', 'New Residential Housing development in Hackney, East London of 475no units of mutiple new and refurbished buildings/block (Class C3 residential). Class A, B and D1/2 commercial and community spaces with parking for private car plus residential and visitor cycle parking', 4, 24, 1, '2021-03-28', '2024-06-30', 1, '2020-11-04 10:42:26', 'Hepscott Road, Hackney, London', '\"\"', NULL, 'E9 5HB', 2, 2, 0, '0', 0),
(22185, '45 Grosvenor Square', '45-grosvenor-square', 2773, NULL, '45 Gsq.jpg', '280', 'The site is located in Grosvenor Square, Mayfair, and forms part of a large block of flats to 45-47 Grosvenor Square, though is accessed through its own front door. The site is surrounded by a hotel to the west, the block flats above and to the east, Grosvenor Square to the north and mews houses to the south on Adamas Row. The site will be accessed from the garages to the mews houses on Adams Row. The ground floor main entrance to Grosvenor Square will be secured during the contract. The lower ground floor access to the front lightwell will not be used as regular site access during the contract. There is an existing fire-escape route from 45-47 Grosvenor Square to the rear of the block of through the mews houses to Admas Row and also from the rear of the art gallery to CarlosPlace. These routes are to be separated and maintained at all times throughout the contract. This project is the complete refurbishment of a high-end residential project in Mayfair, West London. The project includes the complete demolition, strip out and full refurbishment including M&amp;E, Swimming Pool, Joinery Packages.', 4, 23, 1, '2021-01-25', '2022-03-31', 2, '2020-11-16 15:00:48', '45 Grosvenor Square, Mayfair, London', '\"\"', NULL, 'W1K 2HR', 3, 4, 0, '0', 1),
(22193, 'Netley Primary School', 'netley-primary-school', 2701, NULL, 'unnamed.jpg', '20T136', 'The building works consist of minor demolitions and alterations, new partitions, doors, finishes and fixed fittings; replacement and modifications to engineering services; provision of acoustic treatment. A new reconstructed external play space will also be created.', 4, 26, 1, '2021-02-28', '2021-04-29', 2, '2020-11-24 13:18:50', '74 Stanhope Street, London', '\"\"', NULL, 'NW1 3EX', 3, 3, 0, '0', 1),
