(22248, 'SOUTHSEA VILLA', 'southsea-villa', 3921, NULL, 'southsea-min.PNG', '140/KE-SVILLA', 'This project is set in the heart of Southsea on Lawrence Road. The project is to construct a new kitchen extension to the rear of the property with the fitting of the kitchen and all building works in connection. The property is located on a busy intersection, meaning restrictions will be in place when offloading or removing waste materials from the site.&nbsp; Hartts have been instructed to complete the build in a 12-week window with minimal disruption to the occupying family. Careful programming and time management will be in place to minimise this disruption.&nbsp;', 9, 23, 1, '2021-04-05', '2022-12-28', 0, '2020-12-05 16:11:31', '8 Lawrence Road', '\"\"', NULL, 'PO5 1NY', 1, 2, 0, '0', 0),
