(22318, 'IDSWORTH HOUSE', 'idsworth-house', 3921, NULL, 'Render_29.12.20_1.jpg', '152/SBP-KE-FF/RP', 'This project comprises a high-end kitchen extension and home refurbishment in Southsea. We are the main contractor on this project and are currently awaiting planning approval. Specifications have not been fully agreed yet so we are actively obtaining budget costs which can be refined closer to the start date once planning has been agreed and a final drawing completed. When tendering for this project it is important to note in your pricing document exactly what is included in your tender.&nbsp;', 9, 23, 1, '2021-09-01', '2021-11-30', 0, '2021-01-03 13:06:57', NULL, '\"\"', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '0', 1),
