(22569, 'Sri Temple', 'sri-temple', 2773, NULL, 'Sri Photo.png', 'Sri Temple', 'The project is located in Manor Park area in East London. The site is surrounded mostly by residential properties. North party wall is shared with a 3 storey building which is occupied by an off licence store on the ground level and residential flats occuppying the rest of the building. Access road to the east of the building followed by residential properties. To the west of the site across the road a block of flats is located. This building to be fully demolished and then rebuilt to become a care home. &nbsp;', 4, 22, 1, '2021-05-15', '2022-10-14', 2, '2021-03-22 14:08:08', 'Sri Temple, 272 High Street North, London', '\"\"', NULL, 'E12 6SA', 3, 4, 0, '0', 1),
