(22818, 'Amber House', 'amber-house', 9395, NULL, 'Amber House.jpg', 'Amber House', 'This project is the complete refurbishment of an existing dwelling, complete internal reconfig, and a rear double story extension and 1st floor side extension. The project, which is due to commence in early 2022, is in Maidstone (ME15) and will be fitted out to a high-quality specification.&nbsp;&nbsp;', 9, 23, 1, '2021-01-04', '2022-06-06', 1, '2021-08-31 10:58:51', NULL, '\"\"', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '0', 0),
