(22846, 'Arodene Road', 'arodene-road', 2352, NULL, 'Capture.jpg', '003', 'Raleigh Park Baptist Church is located towards the end of Arodene Road, situated within the London Borough of Lambeth, South London. The site measures 474.7m&sup2; and is also located within the Rush Common &amp; Brixton Hill Conservation Area. The site is currently used as a mission hall, consisting of a 1 storey church hall with a pitched roof. The existing building is believed to have been built in 1929, as evidenced by the foundation stone in the existing entrance lobby. The existing church hall has not been identified as a positive contributor to the Conservation Area and is not included on Lambeth&rsquo;s list of Heritage Assets. This project is the development of a new Community Hall and Worship Space (Use Class - D1 Non-Residential Institutions) and 4 apartments and six residential units in total. &nbsp;', 4, 24, 1, '2021-11-01', '2022-10-31', 2, '2021-09-07 06:09:29', NULL, '\"\"', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '0', 0),
(22847, 'Seven Kings Ilford', 'seven-kings-ilford', 17696, NULL, 'seven kings.jpg', 'BM1226', '<p>This project is the construction of residential development on the 573-585 High road site in Ilford. The development of the site provides a part mixed-use scheme comprising 52 residential apartments (Class C3), commercial floorspace (Class E) and shared ancillary floor space, within a part 9, part 11, part 7 storey building, together with associated car and cycle parking and works to the public realm, landscaping, utilities and highways.</p>', 9, 24, 1, '2021-11-01', '2023-05-22', 1, '2021-09-07 06:41:00', '573-585 High Road', 'Seven Kings', 'Ilford', 'IG3 8EE', 0, 0, 0, '0', 0),
(22853, 'Fowlmere', 'fowlmere', 17696, NULL, 'Fowlmere Image.jpg', 'BM1229', '<p>This project is the construction of residential development on Chrishall Road in Fowlmere (SG8 7RY). The development of the site provides 16nr two-storey dwellings; 9nr for rent, 7nr for rent to buy, including site roads, footpaths, fencing, screen walling, lighting, parking areas, landscaping, drainage, service connections, all associated other site works.&nbsp;</p>', 9, 24, 1, '2021-10-04', '2022-09-27', 1, '2021-09-10 10:07:14', '88 Chrishall Road', '', 'Royston', 'sg87ry', 3, 3, 0, '0', 0),
(22859, 'Richmond House', 'richmond-house', 17696, NULL, NULL, 'BM1241', '<p>The design and construction of a timber framed building which consists of 23 residential dwellings, made up of 3 no. 1 bedroom apartments and 20 no. 2 bedroom apartments, ancillary shared spaces including basement, communal lobbies and corridors, and associated landscaping, located at 93 Sherbrooke Way Worcester Park, KT4 8FJ.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>The project comprises the construction of a previous existing four storey residential apartment block. The block will be timber framed with a pitched roof constructed on top of an existing basement car park. The site forms part of a larger estate within Worcester Park in the London Borough of Sutton.</p><p><br></p><p>Richmond House is located within the Hamptons Estate, a development of 645 no. Homes designed around a 12ha. park. The Client owns 17 no. Apartments, blocks and terraced houses within the Estate. The others are either privately owned or managed by St James. The Principal Contractor is also asked to note that there is extensive fire remedial works being undertaken by St James across the properties on the estate and that St James are Principal Contractor for these works. Close coordination with St James will be required during the pre-construction and construction phase of the project.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>The Current site was cleared to the ground floor level slab following a fire. The existing basement car park remains. This will be retained as part of the new construction.</p>', 9, 24, 1, '2022-10-25', '2024-02-14', 1, '2021-09-13 17:32:23', 'Sherbrooke Way', '', 'London', 'KT4 8FJ', 3, 3, 0, '0', 0),
(22894, 'Exchange House', 'exchange-house', 17760, NULL, 'exchange house.jpg', '737 Hagley Rd', '<p>Convert office space into 7 residencial apartments - 4 2bed and 3 1bed.</p>', 12, 24, 1, '2021-10-25', '2022-05-02', 0, '2021-09-30 15:03:25', 'Exchange House', '\"\"737 Hagely Road West', 'Birmingham', 'B32 1DJ', 3, 3, 0, '0', 0),
