(22933, 'Newlands Road Luton Phase 2', 'newlands-road-luton-phase-2', 17790, NULL, 'Newlands-Road-Luton-Architect-4.jpg', '001', '<p>This project is the construction of 340 one and two-bedroom apartments in Luton. Split over three phases; the completed development will comprise 11 buildings ranging from three to seven floors in height and provide a total of 340 one-bedroom and two-bedroom apartments, car parking, landscaping and ancillary works.&nbsp;</p>', 9, 24, 1, '2021-10-14', '2023-01-29', 1, '2021-10-14 09:05:11', 'Newlands Road', '', 'Luton', 'LU1 4BQ', 3, 3, 0, '0', 0),
