(23166, 'The Commons & Ludwick Way', 'the-commons-ludwick-way', 17696, NULL, NULL, 'BM1232 & BM1235', '<p>This project consists of 10 new build properties across two separate sites approximately 1 mile apart. These are being managed together under one Main Contract with our Client.</p><p><br></p><p>The proposals for The Commons, incorporates the demolition of the existing 17 garages to the site and development of 4 new 2 bed houses, with associated amenity, cycle areas, green space and parking. Whereas,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>The Ludwick Way proposals, incorporate the demolition of 3 remaining garages and the development of 6 new 3 bed houses, with associated amenity, green space and parking.</p>', 4, 24, 1, '2021-11-22', '2022-11-14', 1, '2021-11-10 08:52:03', 'The Land Behind, ', '140 Ludwick Way', 'Welwyn Garden City', 'AL7 3PY', 3, 3, 0, '0', 0),
