(23521, 'St Julian\'s Court - Fire Stopping', 'st-julian-s-court-fire-stopping', 17971, NULL, NULL, 'St Julian\'s Court - Fire Stopping', '<p>Newly refurbished office suite in St Julian\'s Court, Guernsey. Fire Stopping works are required to meet current regulations, including a new cavity barrier under the Raised Access Floor, and approx. 8No. service pipes/ducts protruding through the services cupboard.</p>', 10, 22, 1, '2022-03-29', '2022-04-02', 1, '2022-03-02 14:03:13', 'Sequent', 'St Julian\'s Court, St Julian\'s Avenue', 'St Peter Port, Guernsey', 'GY1 6AX', 3, 4, 0, '0', 0),
