(23568, 'Eco Park, Pavilion 4, Aberdeen', 'eco-park-pavilion-4-aberdeen', 9389, NULL, NULL, 'TFT211806 ', '<p>The project comprises a building wide refurbishment of an existing Office Building at Pavilion 4, Eco Park, Craigshaw Road, Aberdeen to upgrade the building ahead of marketing for tenant occupation. The works generally comprise the following:</p><ol><li>Creation of a Business Lounge/Café with Gym including changing and showering facilities at ground floor level.</li><li>Refurbishment of the entrance foyer including new main entrance door;</li><li>Sub-division of the 1st floor office plate with the creation of an office show suite at circa 2,300sqft.</li><li>Refurbishment of the 2nd&nbsp;floor Meeting Room.</li><li>Mechanical and electrical upgrades with new LED lighting throughout.</li><li>External refurbishment with new corporate branding and totems. New corporate branding is also to be provided to Pavilion 1.</li><li>Installation of new Electrical Vehicle Charging Points in the Car Park.</li></ol>', 8, 22, 0, '2022-09-05', '2022-12-23', 1, '2022-07-02 18:24:12', 'Unit 3', 'City View', 'Aberdeen', 'AB12 3BE', 4, 4, 0, '0', 0),
