(23590, 'Richard Irwin House', 'richard-irwin-house', 9389, NULL, NULL, 'AWS004', '<ol><li><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 31, 31);\">With ETZ Ltd now established, ETZ Ltd has a requirement to appoint a Main Contractor to undertake the internal re-fit &amp; refurbishment and external refurbishment works to Richard Irvin House per the designs and specifications presented with this tender. As part of the Main Contractors role you will be required to accept the appointed M&amp;E contractor (who has been appointed with a contractor design responsibility) for the M&amp;E installation; you will be required to coordinate the M&amp;E strip-out and installations as part of the main contract works and manage their works within the main contract.</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', 8, 22, 0, '2022-10-31', '2023-02-03', 0, '2022-09-15 12:29:33', 'Blenheim Gate', 'Blenheim Place', 'Aberdeen', 'AB25 2DZ', 1, 1, 0, '0', 0),
(23591, '50 George Street Richmond', '50-george-street-richmond', 18304, NULL, NULL, '17516', '<p>THE WORKS:</p><p>Comprise of the strip out of existing fixtures and fittings, construction of new partitions, shop front and bespoke fixtures fittings and equipment, new decorations and finishes throughout and the design and installation of all associated MEP.&nbsp;</p>', 4, 22, 0, '2023-01-02', '2023-03-06', 1, '2022-09-16 07:06:48', '50 George Street', '', 'Richmond', 'TW91HJ', 1, 3, 0, '0', 0),
(23592, 'Langley Green, Beckenham', 'langley-green-beckenham', 18539, NULL, NULL, '1773', '<p>The construction of 6 x four storey buildings consisting of 10 4 bedroom houses, 133 1,2 and 3 bed apartments with concierges office and 7 townhouses located within the crescent. Construction of a basement car park with 204 spaces, central landscaped ares with 10 visitor spaces, cycle parking for 286 and refuse stores.</p>', 9, 23, 1, '2022-11-28', '2025-12-31', 1, '2022-09-23 09:07:36', 'Land at junction with South Eden Park Road and Bucknall Way', '', 'Beckenham', 'BR3 3LZ', 4, 4, 0, '32258', 0),
