(23594, 'Aldgate', 'aldgate', 18052, NULL, NULL, 'UPG Aldgate', '<p>34-40 White Church Lane And 29-31 Commercial Road, Aldgate London, E1</p><p><br></p><p>Erection of new building to provide a flexible use commercial space (Use Class E) at ground floor and basement, with 48nr residential units (Use Class C3) above over 19-storeys, along with with new public realm, cycle parking and all associated works.</p>', 4, 24, 1, '2023-01-03', '2025-04-14', 0, '2022-09-26 14:17:27', '29 Commercial Road', '', 'London', 'E1 1LD', 3, 3, 0, '4303', 0),
