(23718, 'New Elective Centre - Homerton', 'new-elective-centre-homerton', 21369, 21543, NULL, '23/964', '<p><strong>Brief description of works:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Works to 1st and 2nd floors of Block 5.</strong></p><p>1st Floor – creation of 2 new DSU theatres, Gynaecology, Interventional Diagnostics, a 10 bed In-patient ward and a urology department with necessary support accommodation.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>2nd &amp; 3rd Floors</strong> – proposed extension – creation of a new plant room extension on 2nd floor including external plant space to serve the new Elective Centre refurbishment.</p><p><br></p><p>Proposed external plant area to 3rd floor (above new plant corridor).</p><p><br></p><p><strong>South Staircase</strong> – creation of additional level to allow access to the 2nd floor new plant room.</p>', 4, 26, 1, '2023-08-14', '2025-03-31', 0, '2023-05-12 10:36:40', 'Homerton University Hospital, Block 5', 'Homerton Row', 'London', 'E9 6SR', 4, 4, 0, '2000', 0),
