(23769, '7 Bentinck Street & 2-3 Bentinck Mews', '7-bentinck-street-2-3-bentinck-mews', 21175, 21919, NULL, 'BST', '<p>The works for Bentinck Street includes Conversion of lower ground, ground and first floors from residential to offices, Demolish rear extension, Construct new rear extension with connection to 3 Bentinck Mews, Re-align floor levels to match 3 Bentinck Mews to match, Facade retention to front and rear and Complete refurbishment. The works for 2 Bentinck Mews includes Conversion from residential to offices, Rooftop extension, Facade retention to front and Complete refurbishment. The works for 3 Bentinck Mews includes Re-align floor levels to match 7 Bentinck Street, Facade retention to front and Complete refurbishment</p>', 4, 23, 0, '2023-10-02', '2025-04-09', 1, '2023-07-07 13:58:15', '7 Bentinck Street', '', 'London', 'W1U 2EH', 3, 4, 0, '0', 0),
