(23805, '165 Moor Lane \'Caretakers House\'', '165-moor-lane-caretakers-house', 21275, 21431, NULL, 'HW23-0013', '<p>Client: Kingston council</p><p>A refurbishment of the now redundant \'caretakers house\' located in the foreground of a school. The property will be used to house vulnerable and disabled residents.</p><p>Essentially, the property is a small 3 bedroom house with front and rear gardens, including a 11m2 timber frame extension.</p><p>Works include:</p><ul><li>Strip out</li><li>M&amp;E upgrades</li><li>Dry-lining - dot and dab walling, skimming</li><li>EWI and render to rear extension</li><li>Joinery - FD30\'s, skirts and architraves</li><li>Contract/soft flooring</li><li>Decorations</li></ul>', 4, 26, 1, '2023-08-02', '2023-09-20', 1, '2023-08-04 12:13:42', '165 Moor Lane', '', 'Chessington', 'KT9 2AB', 2, 2, 0, '0', 0),
