(23816, 'Padfield Road', 'padfield-road', 18383, 21675, NULL, 'W12', '<p><strong>The works consist of: </strong></p><p><strong> </strong><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">- Re-construct 6nr poorly constructed rear infills with new cavity blockwork infills. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"> - Remove the existing warehouse roof covering and recover with new composite roof sheets with roof lights. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"> - Demolish the front facing elevation of the warehouse onto Padfield road and re-build in masonry and composite cladding and automated roller shutters. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"> - Rebuild rear lean-to structures. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">- Floor slab in the area between the viaducts to be broken up and re-laid. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"> - Patch repairs to the floor slabs in the arches. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"> - Full lining to arches. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">- Relocate the existing 3-phase mains and then provide basic lighting and power throughout. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"> - Construction of a new accessible WC block.</span></p>', 4, 25, 0, '2023-09-04', '2023-12-27', 0, '2023-08-18 06:34:09', '244-249 & 824-826', 'Padfield Road', 'London', 'SE5 9AA', 0, 0, 0, '0', 0),
