(23859, 'West Hampstead', 'west-hampstead', 18383, 21675, NULL, 'W12', '<p>Permanent Access Staircase to NR standard design at the back of the fence on platform 1 to allow safe access to the crest of the earth structure and onto the crest walkway. Staircase to be lightweight GRP or similar proprietary product with lightweight foundations.</p><p><br></p><p>Walkway and handrails to NR standard designs to provide a safe walkway alongside the alignment of the existing crest walkway.</p>', 4, 26, 0, '2024-01-17', '2024-06-15', 0, '2023-10-12 13:33:35', 'West Hampstead Station', 'West End', 'London', 'NW6 2LJ', 0, 0, 0, '0', 0),
