(23861, 'NHBC Franklin Court', 'nhbc-franklin-court', 21369, 21830, NULL, 'TBC', '<p>The works comprise of Parapet Wall and Gutter Reconstruction and Associated Roofing and External Repairs. Further headline items of works include but are not limited to the following:</p><ul><li>Full independent perimeter scaffolding, scaffolding stairs, including a full temporary roof scaffold and material hoists for access to parapet wall and roof level. Access must be maintained to all existing main communal entrances and underground car park.</li><li>Electrical works in connection with builders works including temporary isolation and repositioning of lightning protection and rainwater gutter tape heating.&nbsp;</li><li>Rebuilding of parapet walls including new cavity trays, dpc support trays and reconstituted stone stringer course and copings</li><li>Replacement of lead parapet gutters</li><li> Removal of five courses of slates / tiles to eaves / parapet gutter junction to allow for underlay support tray with integral eaves ventilator new section of underlay fitted. Tiles to be re-fixed.&nbsp;</li><li>Localised repairs to torn sections of underlay</li><li> Removal of dry fix ridge tiles to allow replacement of underlay where this has not been carried over at ridge height. Re-fixing of tiles</li><li> Localised repairs to poor lead detailing including replacement of cover flashings and some repointing works</li><li> Replacement of broken/missing copper disc rivet to artificial slate tiles</li><li> Repairs to valleys&nbsp;</li><li> Investigations predominantly of which relate to the presence and condition of the existing cavity trays above all openings and the replacement of a retrofit cavity tray where non-compliances are identified</li><li> Repointing works&nbsp;</li><li>Landscaping reinstatement works</li></ul>', 10, 24, 1, '2023-10-02', '2024-08-19', 0, '2023-10-17 07:32:33', '10 Franklin Court', '', 'Godalming', 'GU8 5US', 3, 4, 0, '0', 0),
